# Line-ending policy.
#
# The test corpus declares exact byte counts and content expectations in its manifest, and
# the round-trip guarantees are stated in terms of on-disk bytes. Letting Git rewrite line
# endings on checkout would silently invalidate both, so everything is stored and checked
# out as LF.
#
# The application itself handles CRLF files correctly — that is a product feature, tested in
# tests/unit/encoding.test.ts — but the *repository* stays LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wasm binary
*.pdf binary

# Generated files that should not appear in diffs or language stats.
pnpm-lock.yaml -diff linguist-generated
src-tauri/Cargo.lock -diff linguist-generated
